# AGENTS.md - instructions for AI agents working on <PROJECT_NAME>

> If you are an agent writing or modifying code in this repository, read this
> file before writing anything, then read [`RULES.md`](RULES.md) in full.
> This file is the **entry point** - current state, roadmap, doc index.
> It is **not** the rules; the rules are in `RULES.md` and change only by the
> owner, in writing.

---

## Mandatory reading before any change

1. [`RULES.md`](RULES.md) - the hard rules and the operating rules. Binding.
2. [`FAILURE_PATTERNS.md`](FAILURE_PATTERNS.md) - append-only registry of bug
   classes that already shipped and failed here. Check your change against it.
3. [`SHIP_CHECKLIST.md`](SHIP_CHECKLIST.md) - the pre-ship gate. Walk every
   item; gates run LAST, after your final edit.
4. [`BUDGETED_DOCS.md`](BUDGETED_DOCS.md) - if you extend a budget-counted
   context document, run its budget check and record the measured number.

