## Where directory-specific rules live

This file holds only what is true everywhere. A directory with its own
technical truths (a backend's migration rules, a frontend's component
conventions) carries its own `AGENTS.md` beside the code; an agent working
there reads that file after this one, and the nested file wins on its own
subtree. Nested files: <LIST_OF_NESTED_AGENTS_MD_OR_NONE>.

